message: "If you use ZeroTrust-FL-Sim in research, please cite the software and the exact version or commit used."
title: "ZeroTrust-FL-Sim"
type: software
version: "0.4.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Shagor"
    given-names: "Shahanur Islam"
repository-code: "https://github.com/smshagor-dev/ZeroTrust-FL-Sim"
url: "https://github.com/smshagor-dev/ZeroTrust-FL-Sim"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  A reproducible zero-trust federated-learning security and resilience
  simulation platform covering non-IID data, malicious clients,
  Byzantine-robust aggregation, differential privacy, CKKS aggregation,
  post-quantum transport, acceleration, chaos engineering, and observability.
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - zero trust
  - Byzantine robustness
  - differential privacy
  - homomorphic encryption
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - adversarial machine learning
  - chaos engineering
  - reproducible research
